WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.840
Today is the day before your procedure, and this is the most important day of your prep,

2
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.680
so let's make it count.

3
00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:11.640
Starting today, you must drink clear liquids only, which includes water, broth, plain tea,

4
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:14.920
black coffee, clear juices, and plain gelatin.

5
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.120
Stay well hydrated throughout the day.

6
00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:21.640
And remember, no solid foods, no alcohol, and no dairy.

7
00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:25.760
Avoid anything red, purple, blue, or orange, as these dyes can be mistaken for blood during

8
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.640
the procedure.

9
00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:31.720
Begin your bowel prep exactly when your prep instruction sheet says to, don't skip

10
00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:33.240
ahead or delay.

11
00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:38.520
If you're on a split dose schedule, your second dose will be taken the morning of your procedure.

12
00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:42.040
Your instruction sheet will have the exact timing for that.

13
00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:44.260
One important note about your ride tomorrow.

14
00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:49.120
Ride shares and taxis are fine for getting you to your procedure, but after your procedure,

15
00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:53.640
you may only use a ride share or taxi if a companion who is 18 or older is in the car

16
00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:54.960
with you.

17
00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:57.760
Going home alone in a ride share or taxi is not permitted.

18
00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.880
Please make sure you have that arranged in advance.

19
00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:00.880
You're almost there.

20
00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:01.200
Stick with it.
